    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The station quickly turned Breckenridge into a major shipping point for timber products like hoops, staves, and lumber.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.breckenridgemi.com/home/our-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1870s, Hood and Peterman opened the town’s first stave mill, marking the start of its lumber industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
