      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.breckenridgemi.com/home/our-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1900, Breckenridge’s economy shifted to farming, with sugar beet factories sprouting across the area.",
